+## Emergency stop dispatch — F02
+
+The three trusted IDE stop commands bypass ordinary queue capacity and resource
+locks. They request cancellation of competing actions without waiting for that
+cleanup; new conflicting work is rejected while stop is executing. Partial lock
+acquisition is cleaned up on cancellation. This establishes queue independence,
+not a measured physical stopping time. F01, F03 and F04 remain unfinished.[^src-20260907-developmentguide-2]
+
